We=E2=80=99ve made these updates in order to:

=E2=80=8A

 * Clarify our data lifecycle and ownership policies, particularly how shar=
ed
   projects work and what happens to your data when an account is deleted.

 * Introduce clearer retention periods for your data and content, with spec=
ific
   timelines for different scenarios.

 * Enhance our data management practices with more detailed information abo=
ut
   how different types of content are stored and processed.

 * Add information about our use of AI technologies in our services, includ=
ing
   details about the models we use
   [https://doist.com/legals/subprocessors?utm_source=3Dtodoist&utm_medium=
=3Demail&utm_campaign=3D2504_tos_updates]
   and how your data is handled. Todoist=E2=80=99s AI features use models i=
ncluding (but
   not limited to) Meta=E2=80=99s Llama and Anthropic=E2=80=99s Claude. The=
se models are hosted
   on our own servers to protect your privacy. Your data is not shared with
   these providers.

 * Improve language throughout for clarity and readability.

=E2=80=8A

